# The stance aiming by hand (docs/manual-aim.md, stage 3): standing; crouched (the sneak key: the hips go down,
# the knees bend, the feet stay); leaning out round a corner (the side steps held), right and left, from the
# side, from behind and from the game's camera (crouched it goes down, leaning out it goes aside, over the
# left shoulder to the left)
cheat god
set time 12 0
view clean
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_01
turn 225
wait 500
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 100
insert BAU_904_BAUER
wait 300
immortal BAU_904_BAUER on
pin BAU_904_BAUER 1500 0 0
aimat BAU_904_BAUER body
stats str 60 dex 60 bow 60
tap bow
wait 1500
cam follow 230 110 90
cam look 120
wait 300

rec stand_side
volley 1 600
stop

rec crouch_side
press action
wait 600
tap sneak
wait 1200
release action
wait 1500
volley 1 600
stop

cam game
wait 300
rec crouch_game
volley 1 600
press action
wait 300
tap sneak
wait 1500
release action
wait 1500
stop

cam follow 260 150 200
wait 300
rec peek_right_back
press action
wait 600
hold right 3500
wait 1200
release action
wait 2500
stop

rec peek_left_back
press action
wait 600
hold left 3500
wait 1200
release action
wait 2500
stop

cam game
wait 300
rec peek_game
press action
wait 600
hold right 2000
wait 2200
hold left 2000
wait 2200
release action
wait 1500
stop
